'''Axes''' are a one-handed and two-handed melee [[weapon]] class requiring [[strength]] and [[dexterity]] to equip. Most axes have no implicit [[modifier]]s but do have high base [[physical damage]] and moderate [[attack speed]], resulting in overall higher damage per second than [[sword]]s or [[mace]]s.

==Mechanics==
A list of benefits that only affect axes and [[sword]]s
*Gems
**{{il|Lacerate}}
**{{il|Lancing steel}}
**{{il|Shattering steel}}
**{{il|Splitting steel}}

*Support gems
**{{il|Close combat support}} can only be used with axes and swords.

